---
/* The teal check in a circle, which the hero card and the feature chips both
   draw. Decorative in both places: the row's own text says what is ticked. */
---

<span class="tick" aria-hidden="true">
	<svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
		<path d="M2 6.5 4.6 9 10 3" />
	</svg>
</span>
